  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into fries. Place on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Bake until just tender, 20 minutes.\n• Remove from oven. Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese and bake until golden, 5 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e741be5481bb7b90ce83c/step-b0814062.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, thinly slice tomato into rounds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e741be5481bb7b90ce83c/step-fda42576.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine peri-peri seasoning, a drizzle of olive oil and a generous pinch of salt. Add plant-based crumbed chicken, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e741be5481bb7b90ce83c/step-9fc29c36.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• With 10 minutes remaining on the fries, in a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e741be5481bb7b90ce83c/step-23ad40b2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, have bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e741be5481bb7b90ce83c/step-a2feeabe.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread the burger buns with smokey aioli. Top with peri-peri chick'n, mixed salad leaves and tomato slices.\n• Serve with cheesy sweet potato fries. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640e741be5481bb7b90ce83c/step-57bfc192.jpg"
    }
  ]
